  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Empowerment of Out of School Adolescents and Youth in La Me, Cote d&apos;Ivoire, Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing self-reliance through the expansion of socio-economic integration opportunities for out-of-school adolescents in La Me Region of Cote d&apos;Ivoire&#xc0ac;&#xd68c; &#xd1b5;&#xd569; &#xc900;&#xbe44;&#xb97c; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xc0ac;&#xc804;&#xc9c1;&#xbb34;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;(Life Skill) &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;, &#xcde8;&#xcc3d;&#xc5c5; &#xd6c8;&#xb828;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc9c1;&#xc5c5; &#xb2a5;&#xb825;(Job Skill) &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;,&#xbd80;&#xbaa8;, &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xc758; &#xccad;&#xc18c;&#xb144;&#xc758; &#xad8c;&#xb9ac;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xc778;&#xc2dd; &#xbc0f; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The major objectives of this program are to 1 Enhance work-readiness skills and capacity for entrepreneurship and employment 2 Increase job skills and diversify income sources from apprenticeship and entrepreneurship 3 Build the capacity of families, local government, and communities to support youth empowerment by strengthening household economies and changing gender norms in the family and community</narrative>
  </description>
